        "rationale": "Hourly costs for Coordinator (EUR 13.45), System (EUR 21.46), Key Account Manager (EUR 23.58), Accountant (EUR 17.22), Reviewer (EUR 22.29), and Auditor (EUR 18.87) were derived directly from the provided empirical data by averaging ranges or using the stated average and converting from PLN to EUR. For 'eco-Advisor', an average of EUR 22.40 was chosen, leaning towards the higher end of the estimated range (EUR 18.87-25.94) given the specialized nature of the role, aligning it closer to a consultant. For 'Customer', a nominal cost of EUR 5.00/hour was assigned, as customers do not incur a direct salary cost to the business but their time can be valued in a simulation. Task durations were estimated based on the provided benchmarks, converting all to seconds. For tasks without direct benchmarks (e.g., 'Choose auditor and arrange the audit', 'Perform audit', 'Sign the agreement', 'Check customer credit-worthiness', 'Accept the advance payment', 'Start the logistics and installation process'), durations were conservatively extrapolated based on the complexity and nature of similar tasks for which benchmarks were available. Standard deviations were set to reflect typical variability, generally around 10-20% of the mean, or half the range for tasks with defined min/max estimates. Gateway probabilities were set to reflect common business scenarios, prioritizing the 'happy path' where applicable, but also accounting for alternative flows.",
